# Load AGENTS.md

Before changing Mord, read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root.

That file is the product spec:

- Markdown in the rope is the source of truth; the screen is a visual projection
- Conceal/reveal and visual ↔ buffer mapping are the core problem
- Do not introduce a split preview or a second rich-text document
- Prefix grammar lives in one place; paint and hit-test must agree

If a task conflicts with `AGENTS.md`, follow `AGENTS.md` and say so.
